  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A striped half treble table runner is 30 × 90 cm of two-colour stripes worked flat in half treble crochet. The stripes are two rows wide throughout; a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "colour change",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on the final yarn-over of each two-row stripe keeps the edges clean. At the stated gauge, the runner takes 90 rows total, 45 two-row stripe pairs. Works equally well in two neutrals or in a bold contrast."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
